        "Content": "Impressive 4/5-bedroom detached family home\nSituated down a quiet cul de sac in a mature residential estate\nProperty Measures approx. 144 sq. m. (1,550 sq. ft.)\nLarge corner plot with private enclosed rear garden\nRecently replaced gas boiler and zoned central heating\nConvenient to University Hospital Limerick and Raheen Business Park\nExcellent access to schools\nBeautifully landscaped gardens with mature trees and shrubbery\nStrong combination of space, privacy, gardens and location\nBuilt in 1993"
